# Purpose
Teach prompt editing, images, Tandem Turns, Agent IQ, support, steering, delivery
and review using the Galaxy Z Fold7 recording as an optional concrete example.

# Dependencies
- ../videos/index.json: greatvibe-mobile-tips, 1462 seconds, 9:10.
- ../videos/transcripts/greatvibe-mobile-tips.md and original VTT.
- Existing footer, steering, Tandem Turns, Architecture and support guides.

# Gotchas
Recorded account/node/worker counts are historical examples, not guarantees.
Apply authorization and runtime capability limits. Guest real turns cannot be
steered mid-turn. No publication of secrets, signed URLs or playback hashes.

# Change History
- 2026-10-15: Add thirteen-chapter guide and mobile fullscreen/supporting copy.
